{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063047/block/singleImage/3263342/df/01M72EMYEBX21YCNPVNKCAYEJG.jpg?updatedAt=1794305170\"/><figcaption>新荷花明掛牌，暗盤最高曾升至203%（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>四川中藥飲片公司新荷花（ 2206 ）將於明日掛牌，全球發售 651.73 萬股，招股價介乎 40.2 元至 50.55 元，最多集資 3.29 億元，聯席保薦人為廣發證券及農銀國際。市場消息透露，其公開發售錄 5.9 萬人認購，錄得 2192 倍超額認購，涉資 729 億元。 新荷花於今日收市後設暗盤。綜合三大暗盤場，新荷花股價暗盤早段曾高見 122 元，較招股定價 40.2 元高 203.5% ，以每手 50 股計，一手帳面賺最多 4090 元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.067174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:06:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.458976+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:00.939466+00:00","content_hash":"f40469ab668a966407d7602ddabe3f4b207cab7b9f228e6e1874fdfd8e4d9f9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.067174+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}